{"symbol":"INNOVATIVE","yahoo":"INNOVATIVE.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Innovative Ideals and Services (India) Limited","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Security & Protection Services","website":"https://www.innovative.in","about":"Innovative Ideals and Services (India) Limited provides electronic and technology solutions in India. The company offers various products, such as VDP multi apartment system; ehome server, module, AC bridge, and Ipad/android touch pad; closed circuit television (CCTV) solutions, such as IP, HD, outdoor, indoor, PTZ, dome, and c mount cameras, as well as DVR and NVR; security device; smart CCTV solutions; mobile phone; cooking system products; and internet and broadband products under the Onyx, Inok, Fermax, eHomes, ARMHER, innoeye, inoyo, Baro COOK, and TATASKY brands. It also provides punnets under the INNOVATIVE PUNNET brand; solutions for packaging under the INNOVATIVE FLEX-PACKS brand; fire alarm, public address, and access control system; fiber to the home solutions; and security manpower solutions. In addition, the company offers e-waste management; business process management services, including developing informational applications comprising systems, content management, document management, and work flow applications, as well as sales, e-commerce, auction, and accounting systems under the BizProc brand; and visitor screening system under the DoorVi brand. Further, it is involved in renewable energy business. The company was founded in 1994 and is based in Mumbai, India.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:30:49+00:00","quote":{"price":19.2,"prevClose":18.29,"marketCap":21.85,"high52":27.65,"low52":12.0,"pe":null,"bookValue":-4.48,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":null,"shares":1.138,"insiders":47.9,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2018-10-05","2018-10-08","2018-10-09","2018-10-10","2018-10-11","2018-10-12","2018-10-15","2018-10-16","2018-10-17","2018-10-19","2018-10-22","2018-10-23","2018-10-24","2018-10-25","2018-10-26","2018-10-29"